Package: locus-api
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: PerishLab <libertecode@proton.me>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/PerishLab/locus
Description: Locus recording service
 Records the Atoms Locus products hand off, faithfully, and serves them back
 for query and bottleneck identification. Ships the `locus-api` server and the
 locus-api@.service template, which drains the Locus buffers registered by
 one user's products when enabled as locus-api@<user>.
